        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 82518,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengetahui jumlah angka dalam list berguna saat membandingkan dataset yang berbeda, seperti perbedaan jumlah pendaftaran mingguan selama dua bulan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"signups_june = [\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"signups_july = [\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Method call",
            "id": 82519,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menghitung total sebuah list, kita menggunakan <code>sum()</code>, dengan nama list di antara tanda kurung, seperti <code>sum(signups)</code> di sini.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"signups = [\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(signups))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"68\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>sum</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>signups</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Negative numbers",
            "id": 82520,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ketika sebuah list juga berisi angka negatif seperti <code>-3</code>, angka negatif tersebut dikurangkan dari jumlah angka positif.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"quarterly_growth = [\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(quarterly_growth))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>-3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Save in variable",
            "id": 82521,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menggunakan kembali hasil penjumlahan list <code>scores</code>, kita bisa menyimpan hasilnya dalam variabel seperti <code>total</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = sum(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(total)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"42\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>total</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>sum(scores)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Simpan total list <code>scores</code> dalam <code>total</code> agar kode menampilkan <code>22</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = sum(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(total)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"min(scores)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>total</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>sum(scores)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Method call",
            "id": 82690,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang dilakukan <code>sum()</code> saat digunakan pada list angka?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ini menjumlahkan angka-angka dalam list</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ini memberi tahu kita jumlah elemen dalam list</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ini menjumlahkan angka-angka dalam list.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fungsi <code>sum()</code> menjumlahkan angka-angka dalam list.</p><p>List-nya adalah <code>points = [4, 6, 3]</code>. Apa yang diberikan <code>sum(points)</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>13</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code>, karena list memiliki tiga nilai</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>6</code>, karena merupakan nilai terbesar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Negative numbers",
            "id": 82691,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang terjadi saat kita menggunakan <code>sum()</code> pada list yang berisi angka negatif?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kita akan mendapatkan jumlah bilangan positif, dikurangi jumlah bilangan negatif</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Angka negatif tidak akan diperhitungkan</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kita akan mendapatkan jumlah bilangan positif, dikurangi jumlah bilangan negatif.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat <code>sum()</code> menggunakan list dengan angka negatif, nilai tersebut mengurangi totalnya.</p><p>Apa hasil dari <code>sum([7, -2, 1])</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>6</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>8</code>, karena nilai negatif diabaikan</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code>, karena nilai negatif dikurangi dua kali</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>6</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Save in variable",
            "id": 82692,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara menggunakan kembali hasil dari <code>sum()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kita menyimpan hasilnya dalam variabel</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kita tidak bisa menggunakan kembali hasil penggunaan <code>sum()</code> pada list</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kita menyimpan hasilnya dalam variabel.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menggunakan kembali hasil <code>sum()</code> dengan menyimpannya dalam variabel.</p><p>Baris mana yang menyimpan total <code>expenses</code> dalam <code>total</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>total = sum(expenses)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>total == sum(expenses)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>total = expenses</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>total = sum(expenses)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Method call",
            "id": 82693,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jumlahkan harga dalam keranjang belanja online dengan <code>sum()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(cart))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"86\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>sum</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>cart</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>List <code>cart</code> berisi harga tiga item. Tampilkan harga totalnya, <code>86</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(cart))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"min\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"max\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"50\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"86\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>sum</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, <code>cart</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Negative numbers",
            "id": 82694,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code <code>-3</code> poin penalti sehingga <code>sum(points_penalties)</code> menghasilkan <code>7</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"points_penalties = [\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(points_penalties))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"7\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>-3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Angka kedua, <code>10</code>, adalah bonus. Atur angka pertama agar penalti dan bonus berjumlah <code>7</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"points_penalties = [\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(points_penalties))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-7\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"7\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>-3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Save in variable",
            "id": 82695,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Simpan jumlah total gula yang diperlukan untuk resep kue dalam variabel <code>total</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sugar = [\" /><text value=\"120\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = sum(sugar)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(total)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"170\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>total</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>sum(sugar)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jumlahkan kedua takaran gula dan simpan hasilnya dalam <code>total</code> agar kode menampilkan <code>170</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sugar = [\" /><text value=\"120\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = sum(sugar)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(total)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"max(sugar)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"170\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>total</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>sum(sugar)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
        ]
